<title>JAPAN: TIFFE euroyen ends up, extends gains in afternoon.</title>
<headline>TIFFE euroyen ends up, extends gains in afternoon.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>June 4 settlement  prev settlement</p>
<p> TIFFE Euroyen 3M (Z)     98.85		   98.80</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The key December three-month euroyen futures contract settled higher on Wednesday in line with a surge in Japanese government bonds, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;Earlier, the market had focused on moves in Tokyo share prices, but attention shifted to JGBs as they firmed due to the release of fiscal reform plans (on Tuesday),&quot; a trader for a major brokerage house said.</p>
<p>The December's day session turnover was 39,826 contracts.</p>
